# Settings > Updates P2 (report 047): the root update, from the question to a rollback. The password is taken
# (env HARNESS_SUDO ok: systemd-run "returns", nothing runs); the page turns to "Updating" at once (the helper's first
# step before its status file exists; the progress bar at 25 %), then follows the status file the scene writes as the
# helper would: installing (75 %, the step's own seconds: 45 s, no guessed percentage), Esc does not leave a step that
# cannot be stopped, checking that 0.8.13 runs (100 %), then a rollback:
# the Launcher level says "Update to 0.8.13 failed: 0.8.12 put back", "Last update  rolled back", and Show log shows the
# reason and the end of the helper's log. Review only: no golden.
title updates progress
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_SUDO ok
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-04
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.12 release arm64
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
update download done
update log helper-rolled-back.log
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
key ENTER
wait 300
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1000
expect_text "Install 0.8.13?"
key ENTER
wait 600
shot updates_progress_start
header updates_progress_start "Settings > Updates > Launcher > Updating" "Updates > Launcher > Updating" "Launcher > Updating" Updating
expect_text "Checking the download"
# the helper's status file: installing
update helper state running
update helper step install
update helper from 0.8.12
update helper to 0.8.13
update helper variant appliance
update helper user pi
update helper started now-50
update helper updated now-45
update helper backup 1
update helper log /var/log/cyberdeckzero/update-20261104-203002.log
wait 1500
shot updates_progress
expect_text "Installing 0.8.13"
expect_text "Backup of 0.8.12"
key ESC
wait 400
expect_text "Installing 0.8.13"
# the new launcher runs: the helper watches it
update helper step health
update helper updated now-3
wait 1500
shot updates_progress_health
expect_text "Restart and check"
# it did not stay up: rolled back
update helper state rolled-back
update helper step rollback
update helper reason 0.8.13 did not start
wait 1500
shot updates_rolledback
expect_text "Last update"
expect_text "rolled back"
expect_text "Show log"
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 400
shot updates_log
header updates_log "Settings > Updates > Launcher > Log" "Updates > Launcher > Log" "Launcher > Log" Log
key ESC
wait 300
expect_text "Show log"
